column4:
Race Rules Description
1. In this event, players must race three cars sequentially on different tracks, and the final ranking is based on the total time;
2. The event consists of 4 stages: Preparation, Registration, Race, and Settlement;
3. During the Preparation stage, players need to assemble three cars and can conduct unlimited test runs. Please ensure a reasonable setup, then click the "Join" button on the left to lock the car slots;
4. During the Registration stage, players must click the "Register" button to sign up. Please note: Failure to register successfully will result in disqualification from the upcoming races;
5. During the Race stage, only successfully registered players can participate. The cars will challenge the tracks sequentially from left to right, and players can race an unlimited number of times;
6. Each player's best total race time will be used for the final ranking;
7. After the Race stage, the event enters the Settlement stage. Players cannot participate in races during this period, so please plan your challenge time accordingly;
8. Rewards will be distributed via in-game mail after the event ends.

column6:
Penjelasan Aturan Balapan
1. Dalam acara ini, pemain akan menggunakan tiga mobil balap secara bergantian di lintasan yang berbeda, dan peringkat akhir ditentukan berdasarkan total waktu;
2. Acara balapan terdiri dari 4 tahap: Persiapan - Pendaftaran - Balapan - Penyelesaian;
3. Selama tahap Persiapan, pemain harus merakit tiga mobil dan dapat melakukan uji coba tanpa batas. Pastikan kombinasi mobil sudah sesuai, lalu klik tombol Ikut di sebelah kiri untuk mengunci slot mobil;
4. Selama tahap Pendaftaran, pemain harus mengklik tombol Daftar untuk mendaftar. Harap diperhatikan: Jika pendaftaran gagal, pemain tidak dapat mengikuti balapan selanjutnya;
5. Selama tahap Balapan, hanya pemain yang berhasil mendaftar yang dapat berpartisipasi. Mobil akan menantang lintasan secara berurutan dari kiri ke kanan, dan pemain dapat mengikuti balapan tanpa batas;
6. Setiap pemain akan menggunakan total waktu balapan terbaik mereka untuk menentukan peringkat;
7. Setelah tahap Balapan berakhir, acara akan memasuki tahap Penyelesaian. Pemain tidak dapat mengikuti balapan selama tahap ini, jadi harap rencanakan waktu tantangan Anda dengan baik;
8. Hadiah akan dikirimkan melalui surel (in-game mail) setelah acara selesai.

column7:
Descrição das Regras da Corrida
1. O evento consiste em os jogadores usarem três carros de corrida sequencialmente em diferentes pistas, e o ranking final será baseado no tempo total;
2. O evento de corrida inclui 4 etapas: Preparação - Inscrição - Corrida - Liquidação;
3. Durante a etapa de Preparação, os jogadores precisam montar três carros e podem fazer testes ilimitados. Certifique-se de que a combinação está adequada e clique no botão Participar à esquerda para travar as vagas dos carros;
4. Durante a etapa de Inscrição, os jogadores devem clicar no botão Inscrever-se para se registrar. Atenção: Se a inscrição não for bem-sucedida, você não poderá participar das corridas seguintes;
5. Durante a etapa de Corrida, apenas os jogadores inscritos com sucesso podem participar. Os carros desafiarão as pistas sequencialmente da esquerda para a direita, e os jogadores podem correr ilimitadamente;
6. Cada jogador terá sua melhor pontuação total (menor tempo) da corrida considerada para o ranking;
7. Após a etapa de Corrida, o evento entrará na etapa de Liquidação. Não será possível participar de corridas durante este período, por isso, planeje bem o seu tempo de desafio;
8. As recompensas serão enviadas por e-mail (in-game mail) após o término do evento.

column4:
1. The Super Peak Tournament is a cross-server regional gameplay, and the specific region column can be viewed in the announcement, and the opening time of the event has been announced, and the competition is divided into the audition stage, the Super Peak stage, the B-level stage, and the settlement stage, please pay attention to the game time; 
2.After the Super PeakRace starts, players can directly enter the event interface to select a vehicle, and players can freely switch their own cars to compete during the audition; 
3.After selecting the car, click Start Challenge to enter, you can run up to 5 times a day, and only record the best time; 
4.During the audition, players can run an unlimited number of test runs to adjust their 4WD through the test run results; 
5.After the audition stage, the top 32 players will enter the Super Peakstage, and the other players will enter the B stage; 
6.Runners who enter the top 32 can have an unlimited number of test runs and 3 race opportunities every day, and record the player's competition time, and the shortest time of five competitions will be recorded; 
7.The settlement time is 23:40~0:40 on the last day of the audition and after the top 32, please pay attention to the time; 
8.Players are not allowed to challenge during the settlement time; 
9.Those who have been eliminated will be ranked according to the results of the last defeat from fastest to slowest, and the final ranking will be determined; 
10.Players will not be allowed to participate in the B Division after they have advanced to the ซุปเปอร์พีค; 
11.All players who do not advance will face off in the B Division, and the leaderboard will be counted from 33rd place; 
12.Competitors entering the B Division can have an unlimited number of test runs and 5 race opportunities per day, and the matching rules are free matching, and all race times except for failures (failure judgments such as rollovers, crashes, rings, etc.) will be recorded, and the shortest time will be recorded for five races; 
13.During the top 32 of the Super PeakCompetition, you can like and guess the champion for the top 32 players, and those who guess the champion correctly will be rewarded, and they will not be able to like after the top 32 ends; 
14.If a player abandons the race during the Super PeakTournament, he or she will not be able to get any rewards, please pay attention to the competition time and participate in the competition in time; 
Super PeakTournament reward grading
1st, 2nd, 3rd-4th, 5th-8th, 9th-16th, 17th-32nd, the rewards for each bracket ranking range are the same, corresponding to 32 to 16, 16 to 8, 8 to 4, 4 to 2, and the finals

column6:
1. Turnamen Super Peak adalah gameplay regional lintas server, dan kolom wilayah spesifik dapat dilihat di pengumuman, dan waktu pembukaan acara telah diumumkan, dan kompetisi dibagi menjadi tahap audisi, babak Super Peak , tahap level B, dan tahap penyelesaian, harap perhatikan waktu permainan; 
2.Setelah Super Peak Race dimulai, pemain dapat langsung masuk ke antarmuka acara untuk memilih kendaraan, dan pemain dapat dengan bebas mengganti mobilnya sendiri untuk berkompetisi selama audisi; 
3.Setelah memilih mobil, klik Mulai Tantangan untuk masuk, Anda dapat berlari hingga 5 kali sehari, dan hanya mencatat waktu terbaik; 
4.Selama audisi, pemain dapat menjalankan uji coba dalam jumlah tak terbatas untuk menyesuaikan 4WD mereka melalui hasil uji coba; 
5.Setelah tahap audisi, 32 pemain teratas akan memasuki tahap Super Peak, dan pemain lainnya akan memasuki tahap B; 
6.Pelari yang masuk 32 besar dapat melakukan uji coba dalam jumlah tak terbatas dan 3 peluang balapan setiap hari, serta mencatat waktu kompetisi pemain, dan waktu terpendek dari lima kompetisi akan dicatat; 
7.Waktu penyelesaian adalah 23:40~0:40 pada hari terakhir audisi dan setelah 32 besar, harap perhatikan waktunya; 
8.Pemain tidak diperbolehkan menantang selama waktu penyelesaian; 
9.Mereka yang tersingkir akan diberi peringkat berdasarkan hasil kekalahan terakhir dari yang tercepat hingga yang paling lambat, dan peringkat akhir akan ditentukan; 
10.Pemain tidak akan diizinkan untuk berpartisipasi dalam Divisi B setelah mereka melaju ke Divisi B; 
11.Semua pemain yang tidak maju akan berhadapan di Divisi B, dan papan peringkat akan dihitung dari posisi ke-33; 
12.Pesaing yang memasuki Divisi B dapat melakukan uji coba dalam jumlah tak terbatas dan 5 peluang balapan per hari, dan aturan pencocokan adalah pencocokan bebas, dan semua waktu balapan kecuali kegagalan (penilaian kegagalan seperti rollover, tabrakan, ring, dll. .) akan dicatat, dan waktu terpendek akan dicatat untuk lima balapan; 
13.Selama 32 besar Kompetisi Super Puncak, Anda dapat menyukai dan menebak juara untuk 32 pemain teratas, dan mereka yang menebak juara dengan benar akan diberi hadiah, dan mereka tidak akan dapat menyukai setelah 32 besar berakhir; 
14.Jika pemain meninggalkan perlombaan selama Turnamen Puncak Super, dia tidak akan bisa mendapatkan hadiah apa pun, harap perhatikan waktu kompetisi dan berpartisipasi dalam kompetisi tepat waktu; 
Hadiah Super PeakTournament dinilai
1, 2, 3-4, 5-8, 9-16, 17-32, hadiah untuk setiap rentang peringkat braket adalah sama, sesuai dengan 32 hingga 16, 16 hingga 8, 8 hingga 4 , 4 banding 2, dan final

column7:
1. O Torneio Superpico é um jogo regional entre servidores cruzados, e a coluna de região específica pode ser visualizada no anúncio, e o horário de abertura do evento foi anunciado, e a competição é dividida em etapa de audição, etapa Superpico, etapa B e etapa de liquidação, por favor, preste atenção ao tempo de jogo; 
2. Após o início da Corrida Superpico, os jogadores podem entrar diretamente na interface do evento para selecionar um veículo, e os jogadores podem alternar livremente seus próprios carros para competir durante a audição; Depois de selecionar o carro, clique em Iniciar Desafio para entrar, você pode correr até 5 vezes por dia e registrar apenas o melhor tempo; Durante a audição, os jogadores podem fazer um número ilimitado de corridas de teste para ajustar seu 4WD através dos resultados das corridas de teste; 
5. Após a etapa de audição, os 32 melhores jogadores entrarão na etapa Superpico, e os outros jogadores entrarão na etapa B. 6. Os corredores que entrarem no top 32 podem fazer um número ilimitado de corridas de teste e ter 3 oportunidades de corrida todos os dias, e registrar o tempo de competição do jogador, e o menor tempo de cinco competições será registrado; 
7. O horário de liquidação é das 23:40 às 0:40 no último dia da audição e após o top 32, por favor, preste atenção ao horário; 
8. Os jogadores não têm permissão para desafiar durante o horário de liquidação; 
9. Aqueles que foram eliminados serão classificados de acordo com os resultados da última derrota do mais rápido para o mais lento, e a classificação final será determinada; 
10. Os jogadores não poderão participar da Divisão B após avançarem para o Superpico; 
11. Todos os jogadores que não avançarem enfrentarão na Divisão B, e a classificação será contada a partir do 33º lugar; 
12. Os competidores que entrarem na Divisão B podem fazer um número ilimitado de corridas de teste e 5 oportunidades de corrida por dia, e as regras de correspondência são correspondência livre, e todos os tempos de corrida, exceto falhas (julgamentos de falha como capotamentos, colisões, anéis, etc.), serão registrados, e o menor tempo será registrado para cinco corridas; 
13. Durante o top 32 da Competição Superpico, você pode curtir e adivinhar o campeão para os 32 melhores jogadores, e aqueles que acertarem o campeão receberão recompensas, e eles não poderão curtir após o término do top 32; 
14. Se um jogador abandonar a corrida durante o Torneio Superpico, ele não poderá obter nenhuma recompensa, por favor, preste atenção ao tempo da competição e participe da competição a tempo; 
Recompensa por classificação do Torneio Superpico
1º, 2º, 3º-4º, 5º-8º, 9º-16º, 17º-32º, as recompensas para cada faixa de classificação de bracket são as mesmas, correspondendo de 32 a 16, de 16 a 8, de 8 a 4, de 4 a 2, e a final

column4:
European Cup Guessing Game Instructions:
Players can purchase guessing coins through the mall, which can be used to exchange item or predict on matches in the mall; the guessing results in the game are consistent with the results of the European Cup; the results of the European Cup will be synchronized to the game after the match, and players can receive corresponding guessing rewards after synchronization;
Guessing Coins: can be purchased in the mall, and can be used to exchange item or predict on matches in the mall;
Guessing Time: players can predict before the current match starts, and predicts use guessing coins, which cannot be changed after guessing, so please choose carefully;
Reward Multiplier: The displayed reward multiples will not change, and the undisplayed reward multiples will be updated according to the schedule. Players need to pay attention to the changes in the reward multiples of the subsequent schedules in the game; 
Guessing Rewards: If the guessing result currently selected by the player is consistent with the match result, the guessing reward will be received according to the reward multiplier; if the guessing results are inconsistent, according to the rule of 1 guessing coin = 200 gold coins, the corresponding number of gold coins will be received when claiming the guessing; 
Receiving rewards: The match results are not synchronized in real time. Please wait for the match results to be updated to the game, and then receive the corresponding rewards in the event interface;

column6:
Petunjuk bermain tebakan Piala Eropa:
Pemain dapat membeli koin tebakan melalui mall, yang dapat digunakan untuk menukar item atau memprediksi pertandingan di mall; hasil tebakan pada pertandingan tersebut sesuai dengan hasil Piala Eropa; hasil Piala Eropa akan disinkronkan ke permainan setelah pertandingan, dan pemain dapat menerima hadiah tebakan yang sesuai setelah sinkronisasi;
Koin Tebakan: dapat dibeli di mal, dan dapat digunakan untuk menukar item atau memprediksi pertandingan di mal;
Waktu Menebak: pemain dapat memprediksi sebelum pertandingan saat ini dimulai, dan memprediksi menggunakan koin tebakan, yang tidak dapat diubah setelah menebak, jadi harap pilih dengan hati-hati;
Pengganda Hadiah: Kelipatan hadiah yang ditampilkan tidak akan berubah, dan kelipatan hadiah yang tidak ditampilkan akan diperbarui sesuai jadwal. Pemain perlu memperhatikan perubahan kelipatan hadiah dari jadwal berikutnya dalam permainan; 
Hadiah Tebakan: Jika hasil tebakan yang dipilih pemain saat ini sesuai dengan hasil pertandingan, maka hadiah tebakan akan diterima sesuai dengan pengganda hadiah; jika hasil tebakan tidak konsisten, sesuai aturan 1 koin tebakan = 200 koin emas, jumlah koin emas yang sesuai akan diterima saat mengklaim tebakan; 
Menerima hadiah: Hasil pertandingan tidak disinkronkan secara real time. Harap tunggu hingga hasil pertandingan diperbarui ke dalam game, lalu terima hadiah yang sesuai di lobi acara;

column7:
Instruções do jogo de adivinhação da Copa da Europa:
Os jogadores podem comprar moedas de adivinhação no shopping, que podem ser usadas para trocar itens ou prever partidas no shopping; os resultados das adivinhações no jogo são consistentes com os resultados da Taça dos Campeões Europeus; os resultados da Copa da Europa serão sincronizados com o jogo após a partida, e os jogadores poderão receber recompensas de adivinhação correspondentes após a sincronização;
Moedas de Adivinhação: podem ser compradas no shopping e podem ser usadas para trocar itens ou prever partidas no shopping;
Tempo de adivinhação: os jogadores podem prever antes do início da partida atual e as previsões usam moedas de adivinhação, que não podem ser alteradas após a adivinhação, então escolha com cuidado;
Multiplicador de recompensa: Os múltiplos de recompensa exibidos não serão alterados e os múltiplos de recompensa não exibidos serão atualizados de acordo com o cronograma. Os jogadores precisam prestar atenção às mudanças nos múltiplos de recompensa das programações subsequentes do jogo; 
Recompensas de adivinhação: Se o resultado de adivinhação atualmente selecionado pelo jogador for consistente com o resultado da partida, a recompensa de adivinhação será recebida de acordo com o multiplicador de recompensa; se os resultados da adivinhação forem inconsistentes, de acordo com a regra de 1 moeda adivinhada = 200 moedas de ouro, o número correspondente de moedas de ouro será recebido ao reivindicar a adivinhação; 
Recebendo recompensas: Os resultados da partida não são sincronizados em tempo real. Aguarde até que os resultados da partida sejam atualizados no jogo e receba as recompensas correspondentes na interface do evento;

column4:
America's Cup Guessing Game Instructions:
Players can purchase guessing coins through the mall, which can be used to redeem item or guess matches in the mall; the guessing results in the game are consistent with the results of the America's Cup; the results of the America's Cup will be synchronized to the game after the match, and players can receive corresponding guessing rewards after synchronization;
Guessing Coins: can be purchased in the mall, and can be used to redeem item or guess matches in the mall;
Guessing Time: players can guess before the current match starts, and guessing uses guessing coins. Guessing cannot be changed after guessing, so please choose carefully;
Reward Multiplier: The displayed reward multiples will not change, and the undisplayed reward multiples will be updated according to the schedule. Players need to pay attention to the changes in the reward multiples of the subsequent schedules in the game; 
Guessing Rewards: If the guessing result currently selected by the player is consistent with the match result, the guessing reward will be received according to the reward multiplier; if the guessing results are inconsistent, according to the rule of 1 guessing coin = 200 gold coins, the corresponding number of gold coins will be received when claiming the guessing; 
Receiving rewards: The match results are not synchronized in real time. Please wait for the match results to be updated to the game, and then collect the corresponding rewards in the event interface;

